#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.replace.rst:2
msgid "maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.replace"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.missing.fill.replace:1 of
msgid "Replace values in the LiteFrame."
msgstr "替换 LiteFrame 中的值。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.missing.fill.replace:3 of
msgid ""
"When ``to_replace`` is ``None``, behaves like ``fillna`` (replaces only "
"NA/null values).  When ``to_replace`` is a scalar, replaces all "
"occurrences of that value with ``value`` across every column."
msgstr ""
"当 ``to_replace`` 为 ``None`` 时，行为类似于 ``fillna``（仅替换 NA/null "
"值）。当 ``to_replace`` 是标量时，替换每一列中该值的所有出现次数，并用 ``"
"value`` 替换。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.missing.fill.replace of
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.missing.fill.replace:7 of
msgid ""
"Value to replace.  When ``None`` (the default), only NA/null values are "
"replaced, behaving like :func:`fillna`.  Only scalar ``to_replace`` is "
"supported."
msgstr ""
"要替换的值。当为 ``None`` 时（默认值），仅替换 NA/null 值，行为类似于 :"
"func:`fillna`。仅支持标量 ``to_replace``。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.missing.fill.replace:11 of
msgid ""
"Replacement value used in place of ``to_replace`` (or in place of NA when"
" ``to_replace`` is ``None``)."
msgstr ""
"用于替换 ``to_replace`` 的值（或当 ``to_replace`` 为 ``None`` 时替换 NA "
"的值）。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.missing.fill.replace of
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.missing.fill.replace:15 of
msgid "LiteFrame with matching values replaced."
msgstr "匹配值被替换后的 LiteFrame。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.missing.fill.replace of
msgid "返回类型"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.missing.fill.replace:20 of
msgid ":py:obj:`fillna`"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.missing.fill.replace:21 of
msgid "Fill missing values."
msgstr "填充缺失值。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.missing.fill.replace:23 of
msgid ":py:obj:`where`"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.missing.fill.replace:24 of
msgid "Replace values where a condition is False."
msgstr "在条件为 False 时替换值。"

